  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Camping de la Baie, a 4-star site with the Qualité Tourisme label, is in the heart of Cavalaire-sur-Mer, in a green setting, 400 m from a large sandy beach, the harbour and the calanques (Cavalaire-sur-Mer tourist office). It offers pitches, mobile homes and chalets for rent, a restaurant, a bar, a heated pool and a water play area. It belongs to the Clicochic group.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Pets are accepted, including in the rentals. The Clicochic group site gives the rule: a supplement of €35 per week in low season and €42 per week in high season, animals on a lead and vaccinated, two animals at most per accommodation, category 1 and 2 dogs banned. The supplement is quoted per week: for a shorter stay, ask reception for the rate.</p>
      <p>The campsite is open from 15 March to 15 November. Reception is open 8:30-18:30 in low season and 8:00-20:00 in high season, on +33 4 94 64 08 15. Booking is recommended.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: when booking, state the number of dogs and the length of stay to get the exact supplement, and have them confirm your dog is accepted in the chosen accommodation.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The harbour, the calanques and the large sandy beach are about 400 m from the campsite, reachable on foot from the centre of Cavalaire-sur-Mer.</p>
